  "details": "Since you cannot change CPU priority with third party apps or even task manager due to EAC, it would be great if you could do it in game with a setting in the menu.\nHaving it as a launch option is not a good idea since if you set it for example to high, background applications might become unusable, so being able to quickly switch it for example to put in music, and then switch it back to high would be great for people using shitty CPUs",
